Project Description
The purpose of this circuit is to provide an output of either 5 V or 3.3 V, selectable via the switch S1.

U1 and U2 are voltage regulators.

The outputs are available through the screw terminals J1–J7.

Challenges
The project was fairly straightforward, with minimal issues. The signals were neither sensitive nor high-power, so no changes to trace width were required.

A bug appeared during the PCB layout phase: one resistor had both pins connected to ground, creating a short circuit at the top output pins. This was identified and resolved.
